      "prediction": "getCount greater than one with successful completed200GetCount and UI OK; exactOneGet false."
    },
    {
      "cause": "CDP offline failure uses another request/error category or does not affect privileged panel request",
      "prediction": "Offline diagnostics show preflight/GET categories, cache/service-worker responses, or actual 200 despite offlineSetApplied."
    }
  ],
